WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing 'Childhood Home' Memory-World - Living Room, urgent.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Fading. Pointless.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.900 align:center
Kael: Her laughter… a warm sound.

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.200 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Floor's gone!

6
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing 'Childhood Home' Memory-World - Hallway, desperate.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.800 align:center
Lyra: Too close! Keep running!

8
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Why hoard? It slows.

9
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.400 align:center
Kael: Hold… or lose more.

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.700 align:center
Lyra: Not this one. Never.

11
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Memory-World - Void's Threshold, dread.

12
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.300 align:center
Lyra: Gone. The smell… of rain.

13
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.600 align:center
Kael: Small losses… accumulate.

14
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.900 align:center
Lyra: Just a smell. Not vital.

15
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Labyrinthine 'Memory-Maze' - Shifting Corridors, tense.

16
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.500 align:center
Lyra: Which way? It shifts!

17
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.800 align:center
Kael: The path… always changes.

18
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Lost. Soon forgotten.

19
00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.400 align:center
Lyra: No. Not lost. Not yet.

20
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.700 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Memory-Maze - Crumbling Bridge, urgent.

21
00:01:00.1000 --> 00:01:01.1000 align:center
Lyra: Jump! It's falling!

22
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Resistance is futile.

23
00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:04.600 align:center
Kael: Dangerous… so dangerous.

24
00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.900 align:center
Lyra: Now, Kael! Or we're gone!

25
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:12.200 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Nexus of Longing - Core Chamber, dread.

26
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.500 align:center
Lyra: What is this place?

27
00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.800 align:center
Kael: They protect… by devouring.

28
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Peace in the whole.

29
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.400 align:center
Lyra: They twist everything.

30
00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:25.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Nexus of Longing - Retreat Path, desperate.

31
00:01:25.1000 --> 00:01:27.1000 align:center
Lyra: It saw me! Run!

32
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Fleeing is pointless.

33
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.600 align:center
Kael: Faster… it knows now.

34
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.900 align:center
Lyra: Trapped! No way out!

35
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.200 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Crumbling Corridor - Nexus Outskirts, tense.

36
00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.500 align:center
Lyra: I can't. Not this one.

37
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.800 align:center
Kael: Sacrifice… to survive.

38
00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.100 align:center
Lyra: My purpose… my reason.

39
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:49.400 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Narrow, Collapsing Passage, urgent.

40
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.700 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me! Forgive me!

41
00:01:51.1000 --> 00:01:53.1000 align:center
Kael: A new path… opened.

42
00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A desperate act.

43
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.600 align:center
Lyra: Go! Go! Go!

44
00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:01.900 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Temporary Safe Space - Memory Drift, dread.

45
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.200 align:center
Lyra: Why am I here? What was…?

46
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.500 align:center
Kael: The spark… it fades.

47
00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:07.800 align:center
Lyra: I… don't remember.

48
00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:13.100 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Edge of Memory Drift - Void Overlook, desperate.

49
00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:14.400 align:center
Lyra: No… they knew.

50
00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.700 align:center
Kael: Always… one step ahead.

51
00:02:16.1000 --> 00:02:18.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your choice was foreseen.

52
00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.300 align:center
Lyra: A trap. All of it.
